      <span class="feature-kicker">04</span>
      <h3>API-first, built to embed</h3>
      <p class="muted">Every exchange is an API object with status webhooks. Create and track transfers from the API, or embed the setup flow so your customers never leave your product.</p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>Create an exchange with partner, endpoint, dataset, schema, and cadence.</li>
        <li>Record the partner approval state.</li>
        <li>Execute each run through isolated workers.</li>
        <li>Return status, failure details, audit events, and webhooks.</li>
        <li>Monitor API usage and exchange activity in the dashboard.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
